The neural multiple-scattering model weights in
crates/starhermit-runtime/src/script/prelude/volume_neural.ts are from
mjurczyk/openvdb 0.20.0, src/three-openvdb/frame/core/frameNeuralIndirect.js,
and the Lorenz-Mie/CIE tables and generator in volume_mie.ts from the same
release's frameMieTable.js, frameMieRgbTable.js and frameBlackbody.js,
and the environment-light approximations in volume_environment.ts from
frameEnvironment.js (https://github.com/mjurczyk/openvdb), distributed under
the MIT License.

examples/volume-fx/assets/venusstatue.wvdb is the WebVDB asset from the same
repository's src/docs/examples/public/assets directory, under this notice.

